                <pb facs="0932" n="830" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg830"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/678: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at San José</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Chase</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June 13,
                            1919</hi>.</date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.07
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have called gunboat <hi rendition="#italic">Castine</hi>, everybody in danger.
                    Marines needed here at once. City in turmoil. Revolution growing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chase</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
